			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741180601,
					"content": "…谢谢您，梅莘警官。您一过来，那个家伙就起身离开了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180602,
					"content": "没事，只是我份内的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180603,
					"content": "先生，看来我们还是得迅速离开这里，回到佩特莉可镇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180604,
					"content": "我认为那群家伙已经逐渐失去耐心了，说不定…会做出什么过激的举动。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180605,
					"content": "我过会就将此事上报，过几天就会有结果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180606,
					"content": "最好的情况，我们可以派遣几名同事护送你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180607,
					"content": "但我们的人手有限，还要顾及城里的事务，只能护送你们一段路，不能直接送到佩特莉可镇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180608,
					"content": "而且在那之前，你们最好要搬到一个安全的地方住着，关于此事的讨论可能会持续…一段时间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180609,
						741180610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180609,
					"content": "护送就交给我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180611,
					"content": "感谢您。有您同行，那群人一定更加不敢乱来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180612,
					"content": "但迦雅小姐不是在剧团工作吗？你们去佩特莉可镇，那她…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180613,
					"content": "唔，我会和他们一起去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180614,
					"content": "什么？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180615,
					"content": "小姐，我发自内心地请求您。请务必…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180616,
					"content": "亲爱的路通，别试图说服我。我和你的老板一样，无法被他人说服。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180617,
					"content": "但、但我们都不知道会遇见什么危险…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180618,
					"content": "那我更应该和你们一起走了。难道你想让我和上次一样，拿着一篇没头没尾的乐谱离开吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180619,
					"content": "况且，我们剧团的团长对这种「算」出来的乐谱也很感兴趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180620,
					"content": "我相信，他应该也很支持我和你们同行…好，我说完了，接下来我们去哪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180621,
					"content": "和、和在须弥一样，迦雅小姐在气势上完全把加尔恰先生给制服了呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180622,
					"content": "加尔恰是永远赢不了了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180623
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180623,
					"content": "也有可能，是加尔恰先生压根就没想赢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180624,
					"content": "咳！路通，我们得赶紧去找个合适的地方住下了！最好是人多点的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180625,
					"content": "人多的地方…我们也许可以去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180626,
					"content": "不如，去我们的剧团所在的旅馆？那里有很多人，而且大家都彼此认识。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180627,
					"content": "如果有陌生人想要混进来，马上就会被发现。而且，我们团长肯定也很想了解推数机。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180628,
					"content": "呃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180629,
					"content": "就这么办！太棒了，一切问题都得到了解决。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180630,
					"content": "一切问题？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180631,
					"content": "#那就这么定了。{NICKNAME}，这些钱请您收下，就当做是预付的护送费吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180632,
					"content": "虽然不知道什么时候才能出发…但到时候，就万事拜托您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180633,
					"content": "但我怎么觉得，现在的问题越来越多了啊？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180610,
					"content": "我可以护送你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180611
					]
				}
			]
		},
