					"content": "你们后面怎么打算？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185003
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741185003,
					"content": "目前来看，我们还没有弄清楚那群人的身份。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185004,
					"content": "虽然我们已经报了案，但现在没有任何线索，警官们也无从查起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185005,
					"content": "而且，枫丹廷这么大，警官们也无法在所有地方都照看到我们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185006,
					"content": "现在…迦雅小姐居然也卷了进来，这下事情变得更复杂了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185007,
					"content": "希望加尔恰先生能说服迦雅小姐迅速离开枫丹吧。这样的话，我们还能依照原计划行事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185008,
					"content": "加尔恰的研究不是没前景了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185009
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741185009,
					"content": "这个「没前景」是指无法再进一步地提升其性能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185010,
					"content": "但在应用领域，这台「推数机」可是大有可为。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185011,
					"content": "只不过，加尔恰先生从来都不怎么在意应用领域的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185012,
					"content": "我想这也是他经常陷入痛苦的原因之一。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185013,
					"content": "不过，也正因如此，他将一位失意研究者的形象扮演得非常出色。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185014,
					"content": "再见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185015
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741185015,
					"content": "那就拜托您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				}
			]
		},
